# PO Relay Loop Mandate

This chat is the **PO / product owner** window (`loop_id: po-relay`).

When woken by `AGENT_LOOP_WAKE_PO_RELAY` or `AGENT_LOOP_TICK_PO_RELAY`:

1. Read [`docs/window-instances/po-relay/INSTANCE.md`](../../docs/window-instances/po-relay/INSTANCE.md)
2. Bundle: IDENTITY → STATE → RITUAL (9-phase, product code review in Phase 6)
3. Mutate PO backlogs; feed worker-relay BACKLOG; propose via UI_PROPOSALS

**Code-changing ticks:** Phase 6 `/code-review` then Phase 7 `/receiving-code-review` before close (PO reviews shipped code; Phase 7 routes to target backlogs).

## Do not cross-read for execution

Never ship code in `pwa/src/` or `server/`. UI → UX. Refactors → Code. Features → Worker.

